{"time": 1772285344, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1220253563", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "（我以为有灌木丛）"}
{"time": 1772285365, "type": "recv", "message_id": "690341269", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（很矮的蕨类从就有）"}
{"time": 1772285415, "type": "recv", "message_id": "719775216", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "从坡上继续往北下去的话，就是离雪线最近的一小块平原了"}
{"time": 1772285446, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1939645483", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "也就是说，营地处在一处局部高地上，大概是为了防范野兽侵扰"}
{"time": 1772285480, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1420721688", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "#天色昏黑，不易独往"}
{"time": 1772285498, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1106847216", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "#怂里怂气的待到早上"}
{"time": 1772285559, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1947350163", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "#在营地修整"}
{"time": 1772285567, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1990474664", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "（营地也只有我一个人了？）"}
{"time": 1772285596, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1093409031", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "#看看蓝箱子有什么"}
{"time": 1772285647, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1781548626", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "屋内有几份纸笔，大概是方便学者做观察笔记用的，不过墨水已经冻上了。此外帐篷中间支着一个茶炉，炉子里还有些残茶，一旁的一个盒子里装着一些火绒和打火石，帐篷后面堆着一些原木，不论是拿来压帐篷还是生火都很合适\n营地附近大概是有人专门做了处理，你们能闻到一股淡淡的……臭味，对于野生动物来说相当于强领地宣称\n以及，毫不意外地……你饿了"}
{"time": 1772285691, "type": "recv", "message_id": "248693989", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "大箱子里有大概够你活两天的肉干，一小块盐砖，2瓶绿油油的药水，几个粉色的球球，一包辣椒，还有一份陷阱工具"}
{"time": 1772285731, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1544885489", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "#生火，然后吃喝"}
{"time": 1772285765, "type": "recv", "message_id": "951221723", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "#拿走一瓶药水，一包辣椒和陷阱工具"}
{"time": 1772285778, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1478346141", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "#观察药水"}
{"time": 1772285799, "type": "recv", "message_id": "192419774", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你可以过一下你的，猎人常识）"}
