{"time": 1772380218, "type": "recv", "message_id": "307841927", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "(这种龙真的是新手打的吗)"}
{"time": 1772380255, "type": "recv", "message_id": "895753267", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "总之，天已经擦黑的时候，你终于看见村庄的轮廓，和村口那块几人合抱才能抱住的燕雀石。你没从这个角度观察过傍晚的波凯村，但今晚好像村中地亮"}
{"time": 1772380289, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1892268728", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "#小小感慨的同时感到奇怪"}
{"time": 1772380341, "type": "recv", "message_id": "515897577", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "多半是篝火吧.jpg"}
{"time": 1772380384, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1026003975", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "#那没事了"}
{"time": 1772380398, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1223249872", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "(还以为地震要来了)"}
{"time": 1772380412, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1267146266", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哇还有地震光）"}
{"time": 1772380493, "type": "recv", "message_id": "418102212", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "村长依旧坐在村口，大概这是年迈的她吸收活力和朝气的最佳位置，见你回来，她乐呵呵地朝你挥挥手"}
{"time": 1772380545, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1935944781", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "#开心地回应"}
{"time": 1772380563, "type": "recv", "message_id": "629391197", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“婆婆晚上好/～”"}
{"time": 1772380576, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1138645107", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "#抱起战利品给她欣赏"}
{"time": 1772380745, "type": "recv", "message_id": "457371312", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“是大野猪王的獠牙吧？了不起了不起”她点点头。“这样，历练便也算告一段落了……只要井能好起来，村子里就又多了三个年轻的猎人，可喜可贺”村子中的篝火愈烧愈旺，大概成人礼本身也是一个值得庆祝的节日"}
{"time": 1772380776, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1587052440", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“说到这个，井在哪里?”"}
{"time": 1772380781, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1172922382", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“我想去看看”"}
{"time": 1772380843, "type": "recv", "message_id": "160665073", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“现在应该在诊所吧？”村长拨了拨火堆“医生那边好像说情况已经稳定下来了”"}
{"time": 1772380857, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1332038429", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“呼......那就好”"}
{"time": 1772380939, "type": "recv", "message_id": "884395786", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“那我待会儿还会回来的～”"}
{"time": 1772380960, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1044183987", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "#告别婆婆，先放东西，养父母估计还在担心吧"}
{"time": 1772380981, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2006182602", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "#既然井情况好转，也不用那么急了"}
{"time": 1772381000, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1983930683", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯，我去通知他们，晚会的准备早就好了，只等你顺利归来”"}
{"time": 1772381122, "type": "recv", "message_id": "663165638", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“好～”"}
{"time": 1772381167, "type": "recv", "message_id": "608636475", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1044183987]你回到家中，养母在客厅等着你自不用说，先前出差的养父也在客厅踱步，你推开门的时候，他手中正拿着一枚平安符念叨着什么"}
{"time": 1772381192, "type": "recv", "message_id": "922696245", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（要不要起个名字呢.jpg）"}
{"time": 1772381221, "type": "recv", "message_id": "245653577", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "(都行，我有准备姓?)"}
{"time": 1772381232, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1211147083", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（姓不重要.jpg）"}
{"time": 1772381245, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1852471671", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "(但其实喊爹妈也不是不行)"}
{"time": 1772381266, "type": "recv", "message_id": "238579955", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“我回来啦！”"}
{"time": 1772381293, "type": "recv", "message_id": "466971816", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "#东西一放，双手一伸，做出邀请拥抱的姿势"}
{"time": 1772381341, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1250001826", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“啊，塔莉娅！”养母从沙发上一站而起，三步并作两步赶到你面前，伸手把你揽进怀里“怎么样，还顺利吗？有没有受伤？”"}
{"time": 1772381379, "type": "recv", "message_id": "719406644", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“没有哦！很顺利哒”"}
{"time": 1772381391, "type": "recv", "message_id": "955577037", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "养父绕着你转了一圈，你的盔甲上不可避免的沾了些血，不过大体还是很完整的"}
{"time": 1772381410, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1296423642", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“都是些小擦伤啦”"}
{"time": 1772381511, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1327901526", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“野猪王力气太大了，头一甩把我顶飞出去好远，好在我也就着了那一次道”"}
{"time": 1772381539, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1486062199", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "#看着老爹的审视的眼神尴尬的挠头"}
{"time": 1772381665, "type": "recv", "message_id": "220327349", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“呼……担心死我了，那天早上起来发现你不在家，武器却还在架子上……”养母松开你，重新从上到下仔细地看了看你“嗯嗯，还是原装，平安回来就好……啊，我去给你把水烧上”"}
{"time": 1772381700, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1347578748", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“今晚的宴会，你们会是主角，可不能邋遢”她说着，就先往里屋走了"}
{"time": 1772381704, "type": "recv", "message_id": "145665292", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“其实我也觉得很奇怪的说.....”"}
{"time": 1772381712, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1585569930", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“一醒来就在那了.....”"}
{"time": 1772381718, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1908542630", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“好～”"}
{"time": 1772381799, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1933280611", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "#简单的清洗一下"}
{"time": 1772381826, "type": "recv", "message_id": "966426921", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“爸妈，井这次狩猎出了点意外，我打算去看看”"}
{"time": 1772381838, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1470390386", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "#喝掉老妈烧的水"}
{"time": 1772381846, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1538066982", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不是被人绑架了就好”养父不动声色地收好平安符，蹲下来用手掌量着獠牙的长度，发出啧啧的赞叹声“真厉害——我活这么多年，第一次狩猎就能带这种东西回来的，总共还没见过几次”"}
{"time": 1772381848, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1399069405", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（huh？）"}
{"time": 1772381857, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2061457918", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（就，烧水一般来说不是）"}
{"time": 1772381860, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1326655578", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（洗澡吗.jpg）"}
